1987..2061 Comment "/// Reading twice is reading once at the same state. The inner `get` is an"
2062..2132 Comment "/// instance of the rule\'s own left side through its pattern, and both"
2133..2202 Comment "/// reducts read once and continue at that state three times (#2116)."
