2379..2454 Comment "/// Put-get, put-put and get-get together, the laws a state-passing handler"
2455..2531 Comment "/// is checked against (`../specification/state-wp.gandr`). A read of a read"
2532..2610 Comment "/// under a store is a redex of put-get and of get-get, and both reducts store"
2611..2688 Comment "/// the value and continue at it twice. Get-put beside them is refused in the"
2689..2706 Comment "/// twin (#1934)."
